WEBVTT

00:12:28.952 --> 00:12:31.205
a face mask or your cellphone.

00:12:32.039 --> 00:12:35.083
All of them show the power of culture.

00:12:35.125 --> 00:12:37.002
Why culture matters.

00:12:37.044 --> 00:12:39.546
But why culture can change.

00:12:39.588 --> 00:12:44.384
And why, right now,
we have an opportunity to rethink that.

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:45.886
Thank you.

00:12:45.928 --> 00:12:50.682
(Applause)